          "text": "Genesis 27 narrates Isaac’s intended blessing of Esau and Rebekah’s plan for Jacob to receive it instead. Jacob presents himself as Esau, Isaac blesses him with dew, abundance, peoples, and family dominance, and Esau arrives too late. Esau’s grief and hatred lead Rebekah to send Jacob toward Haran, while Isaac later directs Jacob not to marry a Canaanite woman.",
